Subject: [PATCH] wifi-scripts: stop emitting hostapd options only qcn-app-extns understands

The QCA wifi-scripts (qca/feeds/wlan-open/mac80211/wifi-scripts) generate
the per-phy hostapd configuration and unconditionally append two settings
after set_default has given them a non-empty value:

    disable_iface_during_cac=0
    athnewind=0

Both are parsed only by the QCA wifi extensions (qcn-app-extns: 
ap_config_extn.c handles "athnewind" and "disable_iface_during_cac").
This build ships the wpad-*-noextns variant on purpose (qcn-app-extns is
not part of the imported QCA source drop, see custom-packages.conf), so
the hostapd binary contains no extension parser. hostapd's config reader
then reports

    Line N: unknown configuration item 'disable_iface_during_cac'
    Line N: unknown configuration item 'athnewind'
    2 errors found in configuration file '/var/run/hostapd-phy00.X.conf'
    uc_hostapd_add_iface: add interface X: phy00.X-0, ret:-1
    hostapd.add_iface failed for phy phy00.X ifname=phy00.X-0

and refuses to instantiate any BSS. netifd has already created the vdev,
so the netdev stays DOWN, no beacon is transmitted, and LuCI's wireless
overview correctly renders every network as "disabled" while the edit
dialog shows the uci state (enabled). All three band-split radios are
affected identically.

Neither option can do anything without the extensions: their defaults in
ap_config_extn.c are exactly false/0, the same values the scripts emit.
Dropping the two appends therefore keeps behaviour identical for this
build and lets hostapd load the config.

---
--- a/qca/feeds/wlan-open/mac80211/wifi-scripts/files/lib/netifd/wireless/mac80211.sh	2026-11-13 12:58:17.455869472 +0000
+++ b/qca/feeds/wlan-open/mac80211/wifi-scripts/files/lib/netifd/wireless/mac80211.sh	2026-11-13 12:58:17.472354721 +0000
@@ -1390,14 +1390,15 @@
 	[ -n "$disable_csa_dfs" ] && append base_cfg "disable_csa_dfs=$disable_csa_dfs" "$N"
 	[ -n "$uplink_csa" ] && append base_cfg "uplink_csa=$uplink_csa" "$N"
 	[ -n "$CSwOpts" ] && append base_cfg "CSwOpts=$CSwOpts" "$N"
-	[ -n "$disable_iface_during_cac" ] && append base_cfg "disable_iface_during_cac=$disable_iface_during_cac" "$N"
+	# disable_iface_during_cac 与 athnewind 只由 qcn-app-extns 解析；本构建
+	# 只导入 noextns 变体（qcn-app-extns 不在导入里），这两行会让
+	# hostapd 报 "unknown configuration item" 并拒绝 add_iface。
+	# 不发出等同于扩展默认值：disable_iface_during_cac=0、athnewind=0。
 	[ -n "$discard_6g_awgn_event" ] && append base_cfg "discard_6g_awgn_event=$discard_6g_awgn_event" "$N"
 	[ -n "$atfstrictsched" ] && append base_cfg "atfstrictsched=$atfstrictsched" "$N"
 	[ -n "$downgrade_320mhz_opclass" ] && append base_cfg "downgrade_320mhz_opclass=$downgrade_320mhz_opclass" "$N"
 	[ "$use_driver_vendor_addr" = "1" ] && append base_cfg "use_driver_vendor_addr=1" "$N"
 	[ "$rpt_max_phy" = "1" ] && append base_cfg "rpt_max_phy=1" "$N"
-	config_get athnewind mac80211 athnewind 0
-	[ -n "$athnewind" ] && append base_cfg "athnewind=$athnewind" "$N"
 
 	config_get same_ssid_disable mac80211 same_ssid_disable
 	# If same_ssid_disable is 1, override same_ssid_repeater to 0
